WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:08.480
Part two: look up a volunteer. Find anyone by name, email, or phone, and see their page the way they see it.

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:14.707
Type part of a name, an email, or four or more digits of a phone number, then tap Search.

00:00:14.907 --> 00:00:21.980
Each match shows the name, email, phone, and status. Minors are marked. Tap a person to open them.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.673
At the top: their email, phone, status, shirt size, programs, and students.

00:00:27.873 --> 00:00:32.994
Update their info opens their paperwork page, as an admin. That's part three.

00:00:33.194 --> 00:00:38.315
Below that is their own volunteer page, just as they see it. Paperwork first,

00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:40.521
then any spots that still need a name,

00:00:40.721 --> 00:00:42.740
and their next shift.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.415
Further down: their hours this season, split by student, with anything still waiting for approval.

00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:56.130
Hours history shows every shift they've worked. To look up someone else, tap Search in the brown bar.
